  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAMOA HEALTH SECTOR MANAGEMENT PROGRAM SUPPORT PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to improve the Recipient&apos;s effectiveness in managing and implementing the Program based on the use of results from  sector performance monitoring.  The Program&apos;s aim in the medium-term (FY2009-2013) is to improve accesst to, and utilization of effective, efficient and quality health services to improve the health status of the Samoan population.   Health SWAP development objectives: To improve the effectiveness of the Government of Samoa in managing and implementing the HSP, based on the use of results from sector performance monitoring</narrative>
  </description>
